    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As Kenya begins to experience an increase in the number of COVID-19 cases, the Ministry of Health says it has embarked on an 'all government' approach in response to the COVID-19 pandemic. As of October 21, the positivity rate had increased by 10.1% with over 45,600 confirmed cases of the virus.",
